			"notes": "The command-suggestion box now opens on the **first Tab** even when suggestions are still being computed asynchronously (often a server round-trip for argument completions like player names). Previously the first Tab was dropped if the suggestions were not yet ready, so the box could need 2-3 presses.\n\nRequires AdvancedChatCore + MaLiLib + Fabric API."
